{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_09a7f91debfcba63c5e9771a9720927ee8fd1e2cb50f8552629075bc657ec1b8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The web tier is described as a browser sandbox where AI executes Python locally to generate PPT/Excel/Word/PDF files, with data claimed to stay in the browser."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1400e8a3294d79dfb611c506cb0482273fcae0d293502ea94d6a026fcc677366"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Marketing copy claims the web chat and desktop client were built from scratch without relying on any third-party proxy SDK."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1cf6aa8c1ccba24981ed55b1b8d53c622428584d74c16e0b0777369c6d9f7c3b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The snapshot contains only README marketing content; no product source code is evidenced, so runtime behavior beyond the advertised claims cannot be verified from this evidence."},{"claim_ids":["clm_451f8cbe9c5e89319dfd944dbbee0050457d78ecd9bf72ffab820a79e569a4b2"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Subscription tiers are listed at ¥49.9–¥1829/month with first-month discounts, plus pay-as-you-go billing with no monthly cap."},{"claim_ids":["clm_58a7535ec2a47a2daa771a5b529cf5be490a71fbf14ba55cb109497b977e782c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product advertises one-command generation of downloadable .pptx files (plus Word/Excel/PDF), including outline, layout, and images."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5aac14504766014011a0f57bf491e306744be11b4952cec491a258e10bc13a50"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The repo hosts the official promotional page for xuanji.dev (index.html, logo.svg, product screenshots) served via GitHub Pages at gary95271.github.io/xuanji-landing."},{"claim_ids":["clm_61e6f513f56843ea442b071d3c25701913e220be06ad02168aec767174f001cd"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The desktop client is advertised as a full Claude Code Agent with IDE-style workspace that reads local files, plans over multiple turns, and batch-produces office documents."},{"claim_ids":["clm_680736e2941b39d67a57dbcbc663be783001801607557909168511cc300730e5"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Advertised model lineup includes Claude Opus 4.8, Sonnet 4.6, DeepSeek v4, Jimeng Seedance, Doubao Seed 2.0, GLM 5.1, Kimi K2.6, and MiniMax M2.7."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8141c7c46e7bc86b7428bd43b82497586522ad15c75eed62dfd68890f1484c91"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A promotion grants a 7-day trial plan to users who star the repo, register at xuanji.dev/register, and verify their GitHub username and email with a QQ-group admin; one redemption per GitHub account."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9a8cf26039fa7898a359225a41df9b17f6fb63f6e5ffde585136dcccf292ffd0"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The repository's stated contents are index.html, logo.svg, and product screenshots, kept in sync with the main site's copy."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c4857e20834c67e76848f76e27ef7657d2eb307b396bd4c5758bba7995705b4b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The advertised product offers a web chat plus native desktop clients for Mac and Windows, with global hotkeys, clipboard/screenshot sending, and no browser-process dependency."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f64e1f94e6cec0a67147547b338df24cabac5d487a5cf73f5dee51342fa22c3b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Seedance multimodal integration is advertised for text-to-image, text-to-video, and image-to-video generation within one workspace."}],"claim_ids":["clm_09a7f91debfcba63c5e9771a9720927ee8fd1e2cb50f8552629075bc657ec1b8","clm_1400e8a3294d79dfb611c506cb0482273fcae0d293502ea94d6a026fcc677366","clm_1cf6aa8c1ccba24981ed55b1b8d53c622428584d74c16e0b0777369c6d9f7c3b","clm_451f8cbe9c5e89319dfd944dbbee0050457d78ecd9bf72ffab820a79e569a4b2","clm_58a7535ec2a47a2daa771a5b529cf5be490a71fbf14ba55cb109497b977e782c","clm_5aac14504766014011a0f57bf491e306744be11b4952cec491a258e10bc13a50","clm_61e6f513f56843ea442b071d3c25701913e220be06ad02168aec767174f001cd","clm_680736e2941b39d67a57dbcbc663be783001801607557909168511cc300730e5","clm_8141c7c46e7bc86b7428bd43b82497586522ad15c75eed62dfd68890f1484c91","clm_9a8cf26039f